 \"snapLen\" -- maximum packet size \"network\" -- data link type \"count\" -- total number of packets read in this file. Your program will have to calculate this and for each packet   a packet number, starting at 0 (See posted format) \"tmSec\" -- timestamp seconds \"tmUSec\" -- timestamp microseconds \"inclLen\" -- number of octets/bytes of packet in the pcap file \"origLen\" -- number of octets/byets of packet on the network (will be same as inclLen unless bigger than snapLen  Sample output format: (newlines don't matter here. Also, order of fields in {...}  don't matter. ","topics":[],"score":219908,"global_rank":205070},{"name":"zachsevart/EECS348_ECLab3","owner":"zachsevart","html_url":"https://github.com/zachsevart/EECS348_ECLab3","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":219906,"global_rank":205089},{"name":"pmh-3/Multiqueue-Scheduling","owner":"pmh-3","html_url":"https://github.com/pmh-3/Multiqueue-Scheduling","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"OS scheduling algorithm that uses three queues to prevent process starvation.","topics":[],"score":219898,"global_rank":205174},{"name":"bnb32/telequad_tools","owner":"bnb32","html_url":"https://github.com/bnb32/telequad_tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Tools for telequad project","topics":[],"score":219898,"global_rank":205184},{"name":"mccartyn/interview-prep","owner":"mccartyn","html_url":"https://github.com/mccartyn/interview-prep","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Interview preparation and review","topics":[],"score":219897,"global_rank":205217},{"name":"akashkumar916/Bobble_internship_answer","owner":"akashkumar916","html_url":"https://github.com/akashkumar916/Bobble_internship_answer","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Assignment solutions ","topics":[],"score":219891,"global_rank":